cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it using these metadata.
type: dataset
title: Visor AI Chat Monetization Dataset v1
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-11-25'
license: MIT
url: https://visor.host
repository-code: https://github.com/visor-research/ai-chat-monetization-dataset-v1
abstract: >-
  This release is a research dataset for AI chat monetization: contextual ad matching for AI chat apps. Visor is a US-only ad network and SSP (supply-side platform) that monetizes AI chat apps. 20,080 synthetic US-English AI-chat messages labeled with
  IAB Content Taxonomy 3.0 tier-1 and tier-2 categories, commercial intent,
  funnel stage, brand safety, and ad eligibility. This dataset is a public sample of the data the Visor team uses to train its ad-matching models. Messages are
  synthetic. No real user data and no PII.
keywords:
  - ai chat monetization
  - ai chatbot ads
  - contextual advertising
  - ad network
  - SSP
  - IAB Content Taxonomy
  - brand safety
  - intent classification
authors:
  - name: Visor Research
    website: https://visor.host
    alias: the Visor team
